        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-placeholder" data-reveal>
        <div class="product-placeholder-img">Product Photo</div>
        <div class="product-placeholder-body">
          <h4>Product 3</h4>
          <p>Details coming soon</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-dark">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-placeholder" data-reveal>
        <div class="product-placeholder-img">Product Photo</div>
        <div class="product-placeholder-body">
          <h4>Product 4</h4>
          <p>Details coming soon</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-dark">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-placeholder" data-reveal>
        <div class="product-placeholder-img">Product Photo</div>
        <div class="product-placeholder-body">
          <h4>Product 5</h4>
          <p>Details coming soon</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-dark">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-placeholder" data-reveal>
        <div class="product-placeholder-img">Product Photo</div>
        <div class="product-placeholder-body">
          <h4>Product 6</h4>
          <p>Details coming soon</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-dark">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ WHY NATURAL STONE ═══ -->
<section class="stone-advantage">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stone-adv-inner">
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="section-label inverted">The Natural Advantage</div>
        <div class="stone-adv-content">
          <h2>Why Choose Natural Stone</h2>
          <p>Natural stone isn't just a material choice — it's an investment in lasting beauty. Every piece is unique, and the character only deepens with time.</p>
          <div class="stone-adv-list">
            <div class="stone-adv-item">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <p><strong>Naturally cool</strong> — Travertine stays comfortable underfoot even in Arizona's peak summer heat</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stone-adv-item">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <p><strong>One-of-a-kind</strong> — Every stone is unique with natural color variation and texture</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stone-adv-item">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <p><strong>Lifetime durability</strong> — Natural stone outlasts manufactured alternatives by decades</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stone-adv-item">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <p><strong>Adds property value</strong> — Stone hardscaping is one of the highest-ROI exterior upgrades</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Quote <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stone-adv-img" data-reveal>Natural Stone Photo</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CTA ═══ -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div class="section-label centered inverted">Visit Our Showroom</div>
    <h2>See &amp; Feel Our Stone Collection</h2>
    <p>The best way to choose natural stone is to see it in person. Visit our Queen Creek showroom and our team will help you select the right material for your project.</p>
    <div class="cta-btns">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Quote <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      <a href="/locations" class="btn btn-outline">Get Directions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
  entries.forEach(e => {
    if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('revealed'); revealObserver.unobserve(e.target); }
  });
}, { threshold: 0.08, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });
document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(el => revealObserver.observe(el));
</script>
</Layout>
